      "detail": "Original String? defaults null; existing Swift safeString normalizes absent/null/unhandled values to empty text and accepts some scalar values as text. The original registered StringJsonDeserializer also converts arrays/objects to JSON text, while safeString drops those shapes. Field-name presence does not establish original null/default or decoder parity."
