    {
      "id": "outer-rule-normalization",
      "detail": "Original registered rule adapters accept an object or primitive serialized JSON, and null/unsupported outer values can remain null. Swift decodeRule accepts an object or JSON string, then BookSource substitutes default nonoptional rule structs when absent/null/unusable. Swift exports can therefore include default rule objects and empty/default fields."
    },
    {
      "id": "content-optionals",
